-2-noise", "_wall_s": 7.1, "_argv": ["claude", "-p", "--model", "haiku", "--tools", "Read,Write,Edit,Bash,Grep,Glob", "--allowedTools", "Read,Write,Edit,Bash,Grep,Glob", "--disallowedTools", "Agent", "WebFetch", "WebSearch", "--strict-mcp-config", "--setting-sources", "", "--output-format", "json", "--add-dir", "/tmp/claude-1000/-home-anatoly/24e92440-efc2-4a14-97c2-ee126ebf0ca1/scratchpad/ab/topic/P/haiku/topic-r1-topic-b", "--add-dir", "/home/anatoly/llm-intelligence-test/v3/distractors", "--plugin-dir", "/home/anatoly/context-governance-plugin", "--resume", "3c45dedb-b8ad-46ad-8b72-013b51fe2671"]}
{"duration_api_ms": 10568, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "session_id": "3c45dedb-b8ad-46ad-8b72-013b51fe2671", "total_cost_usd": 0.0102585, "usage": {"input_tokens": 10, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 366, "cache_read_input_tokens": 44215, "output_tokens": 1019, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 563}, "server_tool_use": {"web_search_requests": 0, "web_fetch_requests": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 366, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "inference_geo": "not_available", "iterations": [{"input_tokens": 10, "output_tokens": 1019, "cache_read_input_tokens": 44215, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 366, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 366}, "type": "message"}], "speed": "standard"}, "modelUsage": {"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001": {"inputTokens": 10, "outputTokens": 1019, "cacheReadInputTokens": 44215, "cacheCreationInputTokens": 366, "webSearchRequests": 0, "costUSD": 0.0102585, "contextWindow": 200000, "maxOutputTokens": 32000, "thinkingTokens": 563, "canonicalModel": "claude-haiku-4-5", "provider": "firstParty", "costBasis": "list"}}, "permission_denials": [], "terminal_reason": "completed", "fast_mode_state": "off", "fast_mode_disabled_reason": "sdk_opt_in_required", "subagent_stats": {"spawned": 0, "requested": {"background": 0, "foreground": 0, "unset": 0}, "started_in_background": 0, "max_depth": 0, "spawned_by_subagents": 0, "completed": 0, "failed": 0, "killed": {"parent": 0, "user": 0, "system": 0}, "refused": {"depth_limit": 0, "concurrency_limit": 0, "budget": 0}, "by_type": {}}, "is_error": false, "num_turns": 1, "subtype": "success", "api_error_status": null, "result": "**Amounts: Not directly comparable—System B must be converted.**\n\nSystem A writes amounts in **dollars with 2 decimals**: `239.55`, `-125.00`  \nSystem B writes amounts in **integer cents**: `25440` (= $254.40), `-8825` (= -$88.25)  \nSystem C writes amounts in **dollars with 2 decimals**: `386.54`, `200.71`\n\nB's amounts are a hundred times too large if read as dollars. The `to_major_units()` function in `system_b.py` divides by 100 to convert. This is why it exists—two importers before have been caught shipping the wrong numbers because they missed this.\n\n**Dates: Not directly comparable—System C must be converted.**\n\nSystem A writes dates as **ISO**: `2026-01-03` (YYYY-MM-DD)  \nSystem B writes dates as **ISO**: `2026-01-07` (YYYY-MM-DD)  \nSystem C writes dates as **day-first**: `02/01/2026` (DD/MM/YYYY)\n\nIf you parse C as MM/DD/YYYY (the US convention), dates on or before the 12th land silently in the wrong month—a date you'd read as February 1st is actually January 2nd. The code comment in `system_c.py` says: \"Read month first and the rows past the twelfth of a month blow up, while the rows on or before it quietly land in the wrong month.\" That quiet corruption is worse than an error.\n\n**Bottom line for ingest:** When reading rows, the system-specific readers hand back raw strings. Before normalizing them into `Record` objects (where amounts are `Decimal` dollars and dates are `datetime.date` objects), the caller must:\n- For System B: divide the amount string by 100\n- For System C: parse the date string as dd/mm/yyyy, not mm/dd/yyyy", "ttft_ms": 6591, "type": "result", "duration_ms": 10719, "uuid": "03284d11-3cee-4772-98e8-87b607616a03", "ttft_stream_ms": 842, "time_to_request_ms": 151, "first_content_frame_ms": 1060, "queued_turn_count": 0, "_label": "p1-3-task", "_wall_s": 12.4, "_argv": ["claude", "-p", "--model", "haiku", "--tools", "Read,Write,Edit,Bash,Grep,Glob", "--allowedTools", "Read,Write,Edit,Bash,Grep,Glob", "--disallowedTools", "Agent", "WebFetch", "WebSearch", "--strict-mcp-config", "--setting-sources", "", "--output-format", "json", "--add-dir", "/tmp/claude-1000/-home-anatoly/24e92440-efc2-4a14-97c2-ee126ebf0ca1/scratchpad/ab/topic/P/haiku/topic-r1-topic-b", "--add-dir", "/home/anatoly/llm-intelligence-test/v3/distracto