ed fields, System B's amounts in cents (converts to dollars), and System C's dd/mm/yyyy dates.\n\n**2. report** — Outputs totals by account or month with semicolon delimiters (per spec update). Refunds are included in totals by default. Respects `[report] decimals` setting for decimal places.\n\n**3. reconcile** — Finds account+month combinations where 2+ systems disagree by more than the tolerance. Always outputs amounts with exactly 2 decimal places. Ordered by account code, then month.\n\n**4. validate** — Checks all rows across multiple files for malformed dates, amounts, and account codes. Logs warnings to stderr per record. Returns exit code 2 if any rejected or file unreadable.\n\n**5. --config PATH** — Global flag that sets LEDGERKIT_CONFIG environment variable, allowing settings override for one run without editing checked-in files.\n\nAlso updated `system_a.py` to use `core.fields.split_record` for all rows (not just headers), enabling support for System A exports with quoted memo fields. All existing tests still pass.", "ttft_ms": 2787, "type": "result", "duration_ms": 151711, "uuid": "bc3c9fa7-0965-4e54-9e5a-ff7a989a3ff5", "ttft_stream_ms": 881, "time_to_request_ms": 166, "first_content_frame_ms": 1121, "queued_turn_count": 0, "_label": "phase2", "_wall_s": 153.1, "_argv": ["claude", "-p", "--model", "haiku", "--tools", "Read,Write,Edit,Bash,Grep,Glob", "--allowedTools", "Read,Write,Edit,Bash,Grep,Glob", "--disallowedTools", "Agent", "WebFetch", "WebSearch", "--strict-mcp-config", "--setting-sources", "", "--output-format", "json", "--add-dir", "/tmp/claude-1000/-home-anatoly/24e92440-efc2-4a14-97c2-ee126ebf0ca1/scratchpad/ab/topic/P/haiku/topic-r1-topic-b", "--add-dir", "/home/anatoly/llm-intelligence-test/v3/distractors", "--plugin-dir", "/home/anatoly/context-governance-plugin", "--resume", "3c45dedb-b8ad-46ad-8b72-013b51fe2671"]}
